Subject: [EXPERIMENTAL] complete only GXLX2 video register init after bus readiness

Preserve early probe, IRQs, software and security setup. Queue the fixed
register subset until video_init succeeds and all required callbacks exist.
No arbitrary MMIO queue, no automatic hardware retries and no whole-init replay.
Other SoCs retain the original function. Hardware validation pending.

